# OCR WORKING DIRECTORIES, which ocr_pdf.sh and ocr_listing.sh create
# with mktemp-style names and remove when they finish.  A run that is
# still in flight when someone stages the tree leaves its page images
# behind in the commit -- b21ba39 picked up one 255th-page PNG that
# way.  They are intermediates of a generator that ships beside them;
# nothing here should ever be tracked.
w.*/
L.*/
*.png
